Z||000000||1FST2M6||10-22-2000||04:10 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/drag1_1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/drag2_1.jpg"> <P>spent my friday night making this work.. the owner is a friend af about 3 years. and although he has lots of money and the knowledge to build stuff his tuning skills aren't worth a crap. his firest run EVER in a dedicated drag car was 12.8 - 1/8th mile.. after we pulled the 4000rpm chip out and replaced it with a 8500rpm chip his confidence higher and a little idea of what she'll do at a decent speed his next run was 6.30@109, but according to the accel data logger in the car we had to changes jetting in the 950cfm 3 barrel holleys. and after 3 runs and 2 jetting changes we got a 5.61@131mph!  oh the shopping list is...<P>350 bored +60<BR>400 lunati fordged crank<BR>Brodix heads<BR>cheazy stoc upswept headers.. Borla units to come soon<BR>Weisco pistons, Ferrera Valves with titanium retainers and springs (dual)<BR>powerglide 2spd tranny<BR>Ofenhauser intake<BR>offy cam<P>i'll keep ya posted to the next set of runs next weekend with dual 600cfm carb.. right now on the Dyno it'll lay down 741hp@7600rpm and 620lbft@300<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Shhh.. Top Secret! <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fstcheeto_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
